{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "08323723af6d1577a76768fa64214c371db758b1700accfc784ec5e6770b00c9", "documents": [{"id": "offline-08323723af6d1577a767", "filename": "Partc2.ogg", "sha256": "08323723af6d1577a76768fa64214c371db758b1700accfc784ec5e6770b00c9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/08323723af6d1577a76768fa64214c371db758b1700accfc784ec5e6770b00c9.ogg", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/08323723af6d1577a76768fa64214c371db758b1700accfc784ec5e6770b00c9.json", "format": "ogg", "role": "recording"}, {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1RTCgPQXPfPBb9cHIgQAVfTz0wyw_zygE-C-0-recording-08323723af6d", "label": "Jahshan set 9 · Part C", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [113, 114], "questions": [{"number": 37, "prompt": "Dr Jones suggests that few health professionals currently attempt weight loss interventions\nbecause they\nA have often found them to be ineffective.\nB lack confidence in the chances of success.\nC rarely have time to spare for non-clinical issues.", "sourcePage": 113, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "The specific aim of the trial Dr Jones describes was\nA to draw patients’ attention to the need to lose weight.\nB to reduce the time that weight-loss interventions take.\nC to promote greater understanding of the dangers of obesity.", "sourcePage": 113, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 39, "prompt": "Dr Jones now feels practitioners can justify weight loss interventions because\nA patients are currently less sensitive about weight-related issues.\nB a huge majority of patients feel that it is a suitable topic for discussion.\nC circumstances demand that action is taken even if patients are reluctant.", "sourcePage": 113, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 40, "prompt": "When describing the trialling of the programme, Dr Jones says she was surprised by\nA the fact that most patients offered a place did actually join it.\nB the positive attitude of patients who accepted the treatment.\nC the number of patients who dropped out early.", "sourcePage": 114, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 41, "prompt": "From the outcomes of the trial we learn that\nA the results for all participants improved at a similar rate.\nB intervention was consistently more successful than non-intervention.\nC the advantages of intervention became less marked in the longer term.", "sourcePage": 114, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 42, "prompt": "What does Dr Jones feel are the implications of the findings of the trial?\nA Areas other than weight loss may be suitable for similar initiatives.\nB Doctors may find that their role in the community starts to change.\nC There could be widespread benefits if they were applied nationally.\nYou now have two minutes to check your answers.\nTHAT IS THE END OF THE LISTENING TEST", "sourcePage": 114, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["08323723af6d1577a76768fa64214c371db758b1700accfc784ec5e6770b00c9"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Spoken script, printed question topics and announced question numbers reviewed against the source paper; excerpt questions restricted to the spoken question range", "referenceRecordingSha256": "e88c823b938e36786f60a11e553fc99705867b9a3957de159fb72db4352f40d1"}]}
